 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All eight old kinds kept; Set of parts and Single part merged into Performance parts (t: complete set, single part). New kinds: Method or tutor book, Popular song sheet. Publisher edition lines are archetypes: urtext and classics lines under Songbook (broadened to instrumental volumes, since no other kind takes them), pocket-score lines under Miniature score (old models became archetypes/versions), Novello under Choral octavo. Suzuki book publisher not named (not on fetched page). Breitkopf founding year, Bärenreiter, Boosey & Hawkes, Novello, Hal Leonard, Alfred from knowledge. No piece titles named."
}